<title>HONG KONG: Companion Build interim net up 11.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Companion Build interim net up 11.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   7.49   vs 9.62 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.50   vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.53   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    47.99  vs 43.15</p>
<p>    Turnover		     552.82 vs 471.79</p>
<p>    Company name		 Companion Building Materials</p>
<p>				     (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 20-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   March 17</p>
<p>NOTE - Companion Building Materials which makes and distributes ceramic tiles, marble and granite products, proposed a bonus issue of one share for every one share held.</p>
<p>Share earnings adjusted for the capitalisation issue during the period.</p>
<p>Exceptional gain is mainly from sale of interest in Companion Marble (Holdings) Ltd and exercise of the unit's share option scheme. Companion Marble was listed on April 25, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
